  "description": "This nuget package contains the C# client for Clickker.\nClickker is the REST API for Exact Globe, combining the best Entity Service and SDK has to offer into one platform.\n\nPlease note that this NuGet package can only be used in combination with the Clickker API and does not offer any functionality on its own. please see https://www.clickker.nl for more information!",
  "id": "Clickker.Client",
  "isPrerelease": false,
