  "published": "2026-08-19T12:50:51.547Z",
  "releaseNotes": "v0.35.1.6\n    - The DeliveryDebtorStateCode field has been added to the SalesOrderHeader.\n    - The query used to retrieve the ProductionOrderHeader has been improved.\n    - The stock/adjust endpoint now returns an error when the specified warehouse location does not exist.\n    - New endpoints have been added for locking and unlocking a PurchaseOrder, RMAOrder, and RTVOrder based on WMS status.\n    - Additional validation has been added to the /PurchaseOrder/ReturnPartial and /SalesOrder/ReturnPartial endpoints. An error is now returned when the reported return quantity exceeds the quantity defined on the order line.\n    - The MainContact field of ContactPerson has been made optional.",
